dosiye y'ibikoresho byakozwe neza!

Yashyizwe mu buryo butaziguye:
{0}

Ibimenyetso byemeza ko igishushanyo cyagenwe:

{0}

Jya usubiramo Synix maze ukore ibizamini by'imiterere imbere yo kurekura.

GitHub code yo kwinjira:

{0}

Iryo tegeko ryavanywe kuri iyo kabari. Hitamo OK kugirango ufungure GitHub, shyiramo kode, hanyuma wemere Synix.

Ese uzashyira ahagaragara iyi ngingo ya GitHub?

{0}

Jya ubanza usuzume imirongo y'ibisobanuro maze urebe niba itarimo amakuru yihariye.

Ibi bizakuraho burundu ikoranabuhanga kuri: {0}
Iyi seriveri ifite amateka yo kwinjiza no kuvura kopi zibitswe na Synix na zo zizacibwa.
Ibikoresho by'ububiko bwuzuye bya seriveri bigumaho keretse uhisemo uburyo buri hasi aha.

Ese uzahanagura burundu ako gasanduku?

{0}
{1:f}

Idosiye za seriveri ziriho ntizihindurwa.

Synix yoherejwe mu mutekano:

{0}

Ama password ya Synix abitswe n'ama webhooks ya Discord ashobora kugarurwa kuri PC nshya ukoresheje iyi password yo kwimura. Jya ubiherekeza mu dosiye; ntishobora gukurwaho.

Synix yoherejwe muri:

{0}

Iyi dosiye ntiyirondetswe, bityo ujye uyibika ahantu hiherereye. Synix ziyoborwa n'ama password na Discord webhooks bishobora kuba ngombwa ko zisubizwa mu wundi mudasobwa.

Gushyiraho kopi ya {0}?

Amashusho: {1:N0}
Amakuru ya seriveri: {2}
Umwanya munini ukenewe: {3}
Igikoresho cy'ubudehe: {4}

Imashini nini zishobora gufata igihe kugira ngo zishyireho ibyo zikeneye. Ubusanzwe, icyuho cya nyuma cy'igicuruzwa kizajya kiba gito ugereranyije n'icya mbere.

Nta mwanya uhagije wo kurema iki gikoresho cy'ubutabazi.

